{"id":"winding-grass","name":{"en":"Winding Grass","ja":"カラマリ草"},"desc":{"en":"A plant with tendril-like vines. It's very elastic and sturdy. It wraps around anything nearby. Hikers tend to get tangled up in them.","ja":"うねうねと長い草のツタ。弾性に富み、やた ら頑丈。身近なものに絡みつく性質があるの で、森や山を歩いていてうっかり絡まれると、 外すだけで日が暮れてしまうなんてことも。"},"level":7,"locations":[{"id":"alanya-west-ruins","name":{"en":"Alanya West Ruins","ja":"アランヤ西部遺跡地帯"}},{"id":"southwest-peninsula","name":{"en":"Southwest Peninsula","ja":"大陸南西半島"}},{"id":"silver-lands","name":{"en":"Silver Lands","ja":"白銀の大地"}}],"categories":[{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"},{"id":"threads","name":{"en":"(Threads)","ja":"（糸素材）"},"icon":"totori-category-threads"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":13}